&#233;seau plus fiable et de r&#233;duire les incidents pour les voyageurs).<\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic perturbé","impactedSections":[{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01730","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:67920","name":"Coulommiers (Coulommiers)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71359","name":"Gare de l'Est (Paris)"}},{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01730","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:71359","name":"Gare de l'Est (Paris)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:67920","name":"Coulommiers (Coulommiers)"}}],"disruption_id":"2676ae7b-e7f8-413a-b07a-e2c8e87d10bc"},{"id":"466079f3-8616-4c90-898a-65b76ad03e46","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260928T170637","end":"20260928T184500"}],"lastUpdate":"20260928T171623","cause":"PERTURBATION","severity":"PERTURBEE","title":"Ligne R : Montargis -> Paris Lyon train supprimé.","message":"<p><b>Le train suivant est supprim&#233; :&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><p>-&nbsp;POMA, d&#233;part Montargis 17h01, arriv&#233;e Paris Gare de Lyon 18h44.<\/p><p><b>Prochain train &#224; circuler :&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><p>- POMA, d&#233;part Montargis 18h02, arriv&#233;e Paris Gare de Lyon 19h47.<br><br><br>Pour plus d'informations sur cette perturbation, consultez le <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/LIGNER_SNCF\">fil X de la ligne R<\/a>.<br><br>Motif : panne d'un train.<\/p>","shortMessage":"Trafic perturbé","impactedSections":[{"lineId":"line:IDFM:C01731","from":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:411483","name":"Montargis (Montargis)"},"to":{"type":"stop_area","id":"stop_area:IDFM:73626","name":"Gare de Lyon (Paris)"}}],"disruption_id":"606edb2d-a3bd-405d-991d-958f58f19d19"},{"id":"b182d185-497d-4191-ac9d-b961a743451e","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260928T030000","end":"20260929T030000"}],"lastUpdate":"20260731T103745","cause":"TRAVAUX","severity":"PERTURBEE","title":"Ligne P : Paris Est - Provins 26\/09 – 1\/11","message":"<p _msttexthash=\"613253563\" _msthash=\"1317\" _mstvisible=\"3\">P&#233;riode : en journ&#23